Package: sybilion
Title: Official R Client for the 'Sybilion' API
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Sybilion", email = "support@sybilion.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Wrapper and generated client for the 'Sybilion' Developers Portal API
